WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.820
In the subarctic Lapland region in circles
seen from space.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:18.610
Sami herdsmen are at the centre of a
stampede called a reindeer cyclone.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:22.210
But something's wrong.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.960
The semi normally lit reindeer roam free.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.640
There are hundreds of reindeer in these huge
circular pens.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.380
What on earth is going on here?

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.430
Could this be an culling?

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:41.670
But the Sammy approached not with knives or
guns, but something else.

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:48.480
I've seen this kind of equipment before.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.060
These guys are probing for radiation.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.240
Sensors on the abdomen.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:56.670
Test the tissue for radioactivity.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.620
But why?

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:03.030
This is an utterly remote corner of
subarctic wilderness.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.870
I'm looking at this area and there is no
nuclear plant.

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.180
There's no nuclear testing facility.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:11.950
Why are they testing these reindeer for
radioactivity?

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:19.720
According to the Sami tribesmen here, the
problems began more than 30 years ago.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:26.380
In fact, they know the exact date in 1986.

00:01:27.130 --> 00:01:28.810
This is the year of Chernobyl.

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:33.790
In communist Russia.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:39.910
On April 26th, poorly trained engineers
begin safety tests at the badly designed

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.970
nuclear plant outside the city of Chernobyl.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.370
A drop in power causes a chain reaction and
reactor four explodes.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.430
Firing a deadly cloud of cesium 137 into the
atmosphere.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:01.740
Radiation equivalent to 400 nuclear bombs.

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:08.130
Chernobyl is the single worst disaster in the
history of atomic power.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.980
It's the world's first ever level seven
nuclear incident.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:17.800
But how does a disaster at a Soviet nuclear
power plant have any bearing on radioactive

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.290
reindeer? More than a thousand miles away in
Sweden.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.990
Weather satellites point to the answer.

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:27.860
Up in the latitudes of parts of Europe.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.480
The winds are actually flowing from east to
west.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:33.400
Following the explosion.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:38.880
The radioactive cloud above the decimated
power station begins drifting westwards.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.560
Over Ukraine.

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.420
And on to Sweden.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:48.560
The Soviet government.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:50.810
Is covering up the entire incident.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:57.920
This toxic cloud of cesium 137 is
propagating across Europe, and most people

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.120
have no idea.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:08.600
November 10th, 2016, a satellite flying above
Maryland spots something strange.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:15.740
First thing that pops out is this giant white
bubble here in the middle of the landscape.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:24.550
It looks like a radome, a golf ball type
structure that protects super powerful radar

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:30.950
systems. But at 200ft across, it is far too
big and the wrong shape.

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:33.550
It literally looks like a giant egg.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.930
It almost looks like a spaceship has landed.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.440
It even looks like there's a stairway
leading up into it.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:47.290
What makes the Dome especially intriguing is
its location.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:52.160
Aberdeen Proving Ground, part of Edgewood
Arsenal.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:59.900
The scene of secret experiments carried out
on humans living and dead.

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:01.940
You really have to.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:06.740
Wonder what kind of tests would require a
facility like we see in the image.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:15.240
Possible evidence comes from an FBI raid on
an Arizona warehouse in January 2014.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:23.950
Inside, agents discover buckets of limbs and
a female head sewn onto another body destined

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.320
for sale to the US military.

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:33.610
The FBI files on this investigation have been
sealed, so there's no real way to know which

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:38.620
bodies ended up at which military bases and
what kind of tests they were subjected to.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:45.150
Human experimentation at the base and the
image began decades ago.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:52.030
A lot of work is classified, but some
programs like Operation Delirium, where US

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:57.790
soldiers were dosed with PCP, sarin gas,
just to test the effects.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.610
Those types of drills were conducted at this
location.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:06.730
The authorities claim that experiments on
humans have now ceased.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.060
April 12th, 2019.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:17.730
An Earth observation satellite passing over
the Western Sahara captures this image of the

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:18.870
Richat structure.

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:25.630
The Richard structure is the most
extraordinary spiral like arrangement of

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:29.710
rocks with these brown and blue lines.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:32.290
I mean, it looks spectacular and it's hardly
surprising.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:34.870
People have called it the Eye of the Sahara.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:41.600
Since it was first photographed by Gemini,
four astronauts in 1965.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:46.970
The precise origin of the 25 mile diameter
structure has baffled investigators.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:53.930
Yet the 2019 image reveals another mystery
hidden within its concentric circles.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:06:04.210
In the middle of the picture is an almost
perfect square with loops on the corners.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.880
The presence of the unusual loan structure
baffles archaeologists.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:16.310
What's really strange is that it's it's there
in the middle of absolutely nowhere.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.000
This isn't a place.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.640
It's pretty inhospitable to life.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.350
There's no arable land.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:28.050
You're quite a long way from anything that
could be considered civilization.

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:33.090
How can you possibly survive out here?

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:35.870
Why would you need a structure like this?

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:43.690
According to one legend, the structure is
somehow aligned to the greatest mythical city

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:44.770
of antiquity.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:49.930
One of the most intriguing theories about the
eye of the Sahara is that it's actually the

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.670
lost city of Atlantis.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:58.360
In the fourth century BC, the philosopher
Plato writes about the lost civilization

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:59.830
beneath the waves.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:04.630
Plato's description of Atlantis begins with
an island in the middle, and it's surrounded

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:06.970
by concentric rings of land.

00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:10.930
I can see how looking at the eye of the
Sahara could resemble his description of

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:11.860
Atlantis.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:21.620
Looking at the image, it's immediately
apparent that this is the Saqqara Mortuary

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.830
complex of the stepped pyramid of Djoser.

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:32.570
The pyramid is 4700 years old, making it the
oldest pyramid in the world.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.250
But to a trained eye, there's something in
the image that doesn't look right.

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:44.700
You can clearly see from above something that
I think would not be visible at all from the

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:45.330
ground.

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:53.520
Looking at the image, there is a faint
outline of something underneath the sand.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.660
Further analysis of the image compounds the
mystery.

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:04.800
If you look closely at this image, you can
see that this is actually around the entire

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.590
pyramid and not just on the west side.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:13.160
The satellite appears to have revealed a
series of massive hidden structures

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:16.040
surrounding one of the wonders of the
ancient world.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:24.290
This image is absolutely incredible how
intricate this whole system is.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.660
What are those things for?

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.780
When teams of archaeologists begin
excavating, what they discover shocks them.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.270
It's extraordinary.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:40.190
What these teams are finding is that this is
actually a trench.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:45.920
It's a continuous rectangular enclosure, for
want of a better word.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:55.360
Analysis suggests the giant trench stretches
nearly 2500ft by 2000ft.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.260
This raises a whole host of questions.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:00.640
What is this trench?

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.060
Why was it dug?

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:07.730
And does it relate somehow to the ceremonial
function of this site?

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.290
September 8th, 2018.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:20.440
The Worldview three satellite over San
Francisco Bay, California spot some strange

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.220
activity.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:24.340
This ship has.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:29.290
What seems like a really long tail just
dragging behind the ship.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.880
I mean, what could it be for?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:34.930
It's really weird to see a ship pulling
something so long and skinny.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:42.400
Scale analysis reveals the mystery tale is
2000ft long.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:47.230
You see these tiny little white bulbs along
the line and I'm wondering if they're buoys

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.810
for a net, specifically a gill net.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:57.020
If this is a giant drift gillnet, its
presence here alarms experts.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:03.660
Maritime law prohibits this kind of fishing
within three miles of the coast and with good

00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:04.380
reason.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:11.790
Gillnets are this microfilament curtain that
hangs down from this big line of boys that

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.560
are floating across the surface of the
water.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:19.980
If a fish tries to swim through it, which
they try to often, they're caught head deep

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:21.870
in by their gills.

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:27.750
And their gills get stuck so they can no
longer respirate and they actually drown in

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:28.320
the water.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.300
It's like a giant wall of death.

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.690
Once deployed, Gillnets can be left
unattended.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.650
Because these nets are left alone out there
in the ocean.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.150
They sometimes get lost.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:43.310
They can break away from their anchors.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.720
A big storm can come through.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:48.980
And now you have a giant floating gill net
just cruising on its own.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.540
Every year, a fishery operating in the
Atlantic loses 25,000 of them.

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:58.020
June 26th, 2015.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.570
In orbit over Kansas.

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:05.220
In the Midwest of the United States, the
Landsat Copernicus satellite captures this

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:05.820
image.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.490
This satellite image is intriguing.

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:19.090
It shows a number of symbols, crosses,
lines, X's triangles, seemingly in a

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:22.390
random pattern carved into the landscape.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.940
Some of the shapes almost look like letters
A, Z.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.760
A T. Is there a code here?

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:33.020
Of course. The immediate question is what do
they mean?

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:40.080
When archaeologist Karen Bellinger studies
the image, she sees something familiar in the

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:40.890
patterns.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.830
There are sites around the world where
symbols similar to some of the things I'm

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:53.370
seeing in this image have been found in
ancient, ancient rock art, in caves and in

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:54.480
petroglyphs.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:03.600
Bellinger reveals that nine of the shapes
match a series of 32 symbols engineered by

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.730
our far distant ancestors.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:15.430
They are found in sites throughout the world,
everywhere humans have settled and sites that

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:20.440
are very old, I mean, 40,000 years old and
more.

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:26.110
They are purposeful and they are repeated
time and again.

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:34.000
What baffles analysts is that the same
symbols appeared around the world before

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.250
international trade and travel became
widespread.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.200
The fact that.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:46.510
Only 32 symbols emerge as consistent, utterly
consistent across time and space leads some

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:49.690
to theorize that this is some early form of
communication.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:57.330
If these symbols found around the world are
an early form of language, they predate the

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.920
earliest known written texts.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:02.430
Sumerian cuneiform by over 30,000 years.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:06.690
If this were to be proven, it would be earth
shattering.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:12.300
It would rewrite our timeline for the
development of human intellect and artistic

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.320
creativity.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:21.750
Studies suggest that humans arrive in North
America at least 20,000 years ago.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:28.560
Yet ancient peoples have tended to leave
symbolic markings on rock faces or as

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:31.530
geoglyphs not carved deep into the land like
this.

